{"unit_id":"tag:04W5:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。令<MATH_0002>为态射族（family of morphisms），其各态射的两端是<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces），且目标固定。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 令<MATH_0004>为拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的<MATH_0005>模（module）。我们将<MATH_0006>上关于覆盖（covering）<MATH_0007>的唯一下降（descent）资料称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>平凡下降资料（trivial descent datum）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 平凡下降资料（trivial descent datum）到<MATH_0008>的拉回（pullback）称为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>典范下降资料（canonical descent datum）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。记号：<MATH_0009>。\n<STRUCT_0004> 关于给定族的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）的下降（descent）资料<MATH_0010>称为<TEXTITOPEN_0003>有效的（effective）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>，如果存在拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）<MATH_0011>，它在<MATH_0012>上，且<MATH_0013>同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0014>。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"trivial descent datum","target_term":"平凡下降资料"},{"source_term":"trivial descent datum","target_term":"平凡下降资料"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"canonical descent datum","target_term":"典范下降资料"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效的"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaf","target_term":"拟凝聚层"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底；待决。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"固定目标的族；待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"态射族的对象；待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚","context":"所讨论的模；待决。"},{"source_term":"module","target_ter