{"unit_id":"tag:060T:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节是《下降（Descent）》第<REF_0001>节在代数空间（algebraic spaces）情形下的对应版本。目标是证明，可以通过检查覆盖（covering）的各个成员来检查拟凝聚模（quasi-coherent module）是否具有某些有限性条件。我们将反复使用以下证明方案（scheme）。假设<MATH_0001>为代数空间（algebraic space），且<MATH_0002>为 fppf（相应地，<SPACE_0001>fpqc）覆盖（covering）。令<MATH_0003>为满射的（surjective）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphism），使得<MATH_0004>为概形（scheme）。于是存在 fppf（相应地，<SPACE_0002>fpqc）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0005>，使得\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0006>是<MATH_0007>的加细；\n<STRUCT_0004> 每个<MATH_0008>都是概形（scheme）；并且\n<STRUCT_0005> 每个态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>都分解经过<MATH_0010>；并且\n<STRUCT_0006> <MATH_0011>为 fppf（相应地，<SPACE_0003>fpqc）覆盖（covering），覆盖<MATH_0012>。\n<STRUCT_0007>\n具体来说，先用 fppf（相应地，<SPACE_0004>fpqc）覆盖（covering）加细<MATH_0013>，使得每个<MATH_0014>都是概形（scheme），见《代数空间上的拓扑（Topologies）》引理<REF_0002>，相应地，<SPACE_0005>引理<REF_0003>。然后令<MATH_0015>。拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的<MATH_0016>模（module）<MATH_0017>为有限型（finite type）、有限表现的（finite presentation）等等，当且仅当拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的<MATH_0018>模（module）<MATH_0019>为有限型（finite type）、有限表现的（finite presentation）等等。因此，可以利用加细<MATH_0020>的存在，将以下各引理的证明归约到概形（schemes）的情形。我们将用“<TEXTITOPEN_0001>该结果从概形（schemes）的情形通过平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）局部化（localization）得到<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>”来表示这一点。\n\n","allowed_english":["fppf","fpqc"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent module","target_term":"拟凝聚模"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"证明方案"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"代数空间上的拓扑"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限表现的"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限表现的"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降","context":"引用章名；待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"本节的空间；待决。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"检查有限性的覆盖；待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent module","target_term":"拟凝聚模","context":"完整模词形；待决。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"证明方案","context":"原文 proof scheme 为普通方案用法，保留要求的英文词形；待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"给定空间；待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的","context":"覆盖态射；待决。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"局部化与覆盖；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"加细中的映射；待决。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"覆盖的成员；待决。"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"代数空间上的拓扑","context":"引用章名；待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚","context":"模的性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"给定模；待决。"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型","context":"有限性条件；待决。"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限表现的","context":"有限性条件；待决。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"归约后的情形；待决。"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部